flowchart LR
  Shopper[Shopper] --> Storefront[Storefront checkout]
  Storefront -->|order + payment_method| API[Laravel API]
  API -->|lock cart, variants, inventory| OrderFlow[Order transaction]
  OrderFlow -->|reserve stock, save payment instructions| Database[(MySQL)]
  Storefront -->|scoped payment token| PaymentPage[Bank transfer page]
  PaymentPage -->|read instructions| API
  PaymentPage -->|amount + transfer reference| VietQR[VietQR image service]
  Shopper -->|bank transfer| Bank[Store bank account]
  Staff[Authorized staff] -->|reconcile and mark paid| Admin[Admin]
  Admin -->|payment status update| API
  API -->|record payment + audit history| Database
  Scheduler[Scheduler] -->|expire unpaid non-COD order| OrderFlow
